        "action_date": "2025-02-06",
        "action_desc": "Introduced in House",
        "text": "<p><strong>Restoring American Sovereignty Act</strong></p><p>This bill allows U.S. foreign aid funding paused pursuant to Executive Order 14169 to be used by the President to deport&nbsp;non-U.S. nationals (<em>aliens</em> under federal law) who do not have legal standing.</p>",
